# The lance: one instantaneous full-length pulse per trigger pull, mirrored
# off every reflective asteroid it meets and carrying its remaining distance
# through the bounce. The pickup sits on the spawn so the ship collects it on
# frame one, which also selects it (Ship::add_lance_ammo).
# Semi-automatic, so each `key space` is one pull — `hold` would fire once.
#
# The mirrors (teal) are placed to send the pulse back ACROSS the frame
# rather than off the top, so the bounce is the thing you watch. Ship sits
# low-centre with the geometry above it; zoomed in so it isn't a speck.
seed 31
sim 500
frames 90
fps 30
size 960 540
clear
hud off
camera fixed
zoom 55
ship 0 -230 0
pickup lance 0 -230
asteroid -300 170 reflective r=110
asteroid 330 210 reflective r=110
asteroid 20 400 reflective r=120
asteroid -120 40 r=60
asteroid 165 15 r=55
asteroid 420 -60 r=55
asteroid -420 -30 r=50
key space 700
key space 1500
key space 2300
key space 3100
